config-connector-extensions patch 0010: mockgcp serves IAM workload identity pool provider keys.

For iam.gcp.hfl.dev IAMWorkloadIdentityPoolProviderKey; applies on top of
patches 0006 and 0007. Written here:
- mockgcp/apis/mockgcp/iam/v1/workload_identity_pool_provider_key.proto,
  from the IAM v1 API's discovery document (googleapis has no proto for
  provider keys); generated/mockgcp/iam/v1/workload_identity_pool_provider_key*.go
  are generated from it by hack/regen-mockiam-workload-identity.sh;
- mockiam/workloadidentitypoolproviderkeys.go serves get, create (with a
  placeholder PEM as the public key), soft delete, undelete and list, as
  long-running operations; service.go registers it.
The pool and provider are not checked: mockgcp has neither.
Upstream candidate: yes.

